{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994710706903001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"plain-withe-pedal","assignee":"Joe Oakhart","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Joe Oakhart","head_sha":"c12ad713bcdbbccda4451e43585d09eb01d14583","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: f112-6222-e236-4b09","material: d890240a3d4a4b6f","model: claude-sonnet-4-6","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 8","rebar-version: 0.5.2 (c12ad713b-dirty)","regver: bb57585159a067c5","verified-at-sha:210396a7f09dd61c67a916368b5ae6962c46f8ff","dep cb31c0c8cb729b3821e7f9c40600d1765f49bc1bd0658de7f9c17fd7d79f69bb .github/workflows/release.yml","dep 598b0c38c05c6f44f8244077dee2c280b3cbe6eb60c2251aa73f5d720d498897 docs/releasing.md"],"signature":"7d2fac59c0dead46b1ba34765def97b8db793d833c96e85543cf15b6bee46edc","signed_at":1783301117939533000}},"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":11},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Plan-review PASSED (0 blocking, signed). Advisory triage:\n- f9d23091 (workflow_dispatch guard) — ADDRESSED in impl: github_release job carries `if: github.event_name == 'push' && startsWith(github.ref, 'refs/tags/v')`.\n- f02f12ea (idempotency) — ADDRESSED in impl: job uses `gh release view … && gh release edit/upload --clobber || gh release create`.\n- fcaf8836 (retire/fix path) — ADDRESSED: added \"Fixing or retiring a bad GitHub Release\" section to docs/releasing.md.\n- f2b56a07 (file_impact) — ADDRESSED: set_file_impact recorded (release.yml + docs/releasing.md).\n- fb7da430 / f1e02176 (verify tag set + live GH state) — ADDRESSED: verified via `git ls-remote --tags origin` and `gh release list` before backfill; v0.4.0–v0.6.0 were the exact missing set, v0.3.0 was Latest.\n- f057f471 (end-to-end exercise) — RATIONALE: the new job only fires on a real v* tag push (can't run in Gerrit branch CI). The identical `gh release create`/`edit` commands were validated live by the backfill; the next real release (v0.6.1+) is the true end-to-end. Accepted rather than pushing a throwaway test tag.\n- f607dd45 (compound AC \"and\") — minor cosmetic; not splitting to avoid voiding the signed plan-review via a material description edit.\nBackfill already done: GitHub Releases created for v0.4.0/v0.5.0/v0.5.1/v0.5.2/v0.6.0; `gh release list` shows v0.6.0 as Latest.","timestamp":1783300840830987001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Workflow automation pushed to Gerrit for review: change 314 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/314), Change-Id I9f98b3e. Awaiting LLM-Review + Verified votes. Backfill deliverable already live (v0.6.0 = Latest on GitHub).","timestamp":1783301179175761001}],"created_at":1783300460201998001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"## What\nThe release workflow `.github/workflows/release.yml` publishes `nava-rebar` to PyPI on a `vX.Y.Z` tag but never creates a **GitHub Release**. The v0.2.0/v0.3.0 GitHub Releases were created by hand and that manual step lapsed, so github.com/navapbc/rebar shows **v0.3.0 as Latest** while tags and all three channels (PyPI, Homebrew, MCP Registry) advanced to **v0.6.0**. `docs/releasing.md` does not mention the GitHub Release channel at all.\n\n## Why\nGitHub's Releases page is the human-facing \"what's the latest version\" surface. It being 3 versions stale is misleading to users and contributors.\n\n## Fix (two parts)\n- **Backfill (ops):** create GitHub Releases for the missing tags `v0.4.0`, `v0.5.0`, `v0.5.1`, `v0.5.2`, `v0.6.0` with auto-generated notes so `Latest` points at v0.6.0 now.\n- **Process (code, via Gerrit):** add a job/step to `.github/workflows/release.yml` that creates a GitHub Release on every `v*` tag push (auto-generated notes, marked latest), and document the channel in `docs/releasing.md`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] GitHub Releases exist for v0.4.0, v0.5.0, v0.5.1, v0.5.2, v0.6.0 and `gh release list` shows v0.6.0 as `Latest`.\n- [ ] `.github/workflows/release.yml` creates a GitHub Release automatically on a `v*` tag push (with `contents: write` on that job and auto-generated notes).\n- [ ] `docs/releasing.md` documents the GitHub Release channel/step.\n- [ ] Change lands on main through Gerrit (both LLM-Review and Verified votes green).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":".github/workflows/release.yml","reason":"add github_release job that creates a GitHub Release on v* tag push"},{"path":"docs/releasing.md","reason":"document the GitHub Release channel + bad-release cleanup"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"1e933d57-7b34-4354-9a16-311845a0c198","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f112-6222-e236-4b09","ticket_type":"task","title":"Automate GitHub Release creation in release.yml + backfill v0.4.0–v0.6.0","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a6c0fd5c-17d2-4510-9d97-770983401531","d8bc1894-fe23-4ba2-bd5e-7e062cfa3a83","34d799ed-3ce2-42e2-9833-60811c3714aa","096fe24b-7aba-4ffa-b31d-528c59dadb35","f24371d2-e52b-486a-baeb-a9acf71528aa","b567648e-1ffb-412a-af21-13a34a6d41c4","b760dc49-ead3-4ada-81b3-71d80733ad35","8f55d228-7268-4650-9e6e-ea516129fb38","fd5bfc02-249b-4320-801e-e5aa35660977","1e933d57-7b34-4354-9a16-311845a0c198","54b4311b-3f53-46fe-8e25-89b5b95c3aeb","9410cd85-a3f8-4964-b41a-7cfc2419ca49","5cfe903a-c68f-46e1-b48b-5ca1c39dbf89","859263da-4fb0-4aed-83bc-e8111b246099"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994710706903001,"uuid":"d75251bf-a7eb-464b-88da-f549dec4b493"}